            "   ▶ opencc...  ✅  (1.0s)\n",
            "   ▶ datasets...  ✅  (2.3s)\n",
            "   ▶ rotary-embedding-torch...  ✅  (0.9s)\n",
            "   ▶ descript-audio-codec...  ✅  (9.5s)\n",
            "\n",
            "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
