            "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
            "   Cloning fishaudio/fish-speech...  ✅  (1s)\n",
            "   ▶ fish-speech editable...  ✅  (3.0s)\n",
            "   ✅  /content/fish-speech added to sys.path\n",
            "\n",
            "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
